# A filter land's mana combination. Seat 0's own turn-1 Main Phase 1 with
# Fire-Lit Thicket and a Forest. The Thicket's "{R/G}, {T}: Add {R}{R},
# {R}{G}, or {G}{G}" (`Produced$ Combo R G | Amount$ 2`) asks the seat which of
# the three it wants (`PlayerControllerHuman.specifyManaCombo` →
# `assignGenericAmount`, keyed by `MagicColor.Color`). The Forest pays
# the {R/G} (in prod it was an Overgrown Tomb, whose own "pay 2 life?" on
# entering would stop the scenario before the mulligan settles). Prod
# m-24f69e2e0b7e (2026-10-10) froze on exactly this question.
